# Phase 7 (geospatial intelligence): the Interactive Map Explorer
# renders NO map tiles until this is set -- there is no hardcoded
# default tile provider or API key anywhere in this codebase. See
# docs/operations/MAP_PROVIDER_CONFIGURATION.md for the tradeoffs of
# each option (a self-hosted tile server, a provider's free tier under
# its own usage policy, or an enterprise tile contract).
#
# Example (OpenStreetMap's own tile servers -- fine for light
# development use under osmfoundation.org's tile usage policy; NOT
# appropriate for production/high-volume traffic):
# VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
# VITE_MAP_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=&copy; OpenStreetMap contributors
VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=
VITE_MAP_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=&copy; OpenStreetMap contributors

# Dev/preview server only (no VITE_ prefix, so it is never bundled): where
# `npm run dev` proxies /api. Default http://localhost:8000.
# AEGIS_DEV_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000
